en:
"...So, thing is, we've got ourselves a problem.{w}Ogre Bay's had these special cannon blueprints
handed down since way back."{w}{p}"I got 'em from my old man too, but...{w}see, the... blueprints, I kinda... went an' lost 'em...
At this rate, we can't build it!!"{w}

"'Course I did!
We're shootin' down the Palace of the Sun, y'know?
You'd be missin' out if you didn't come watch!"{w}

"...Right. Hey, you lot.
Pop on over to the Palace of the Sun for a bit!!"{w}{p}"Look, we've got this mighty fine cannon right here.
I'll fire you up there with it!"{w}{p}"Aw, no need to worry. It'll work out somehow.{w}...Off you go!!"{w}

"Don't worry, this plan's bound to work!
Worryin' is a total waste of time, y'know?
Relax and off you go!!"{w}

"So, how's it feel inside the cannon?
Surprisingly cozy, huh?"{w}{p}"Hey, next time you open your eyes, you'll be right at the Palace of the Sun!
Give it your best!!"{w}{p}"Okay, startin' the countdown."{w}

"You did splendidly, despite such a reckless plan.
Now we can rest easy, at least for the time being.
Thank you very much."{w}

"Oh, right.
More importantly, go take a look outside!
Everybody's waitin' for you."{w}{p}"Oi, you lot!!{w}Fire yourselves up! The parade's startin'!!!"{w}

"You lot did good.
See? You made it back just fine, didn't ya!!"{w}{p}"I owe you lot one.
Next time, the drinks are on me!"{w}

"Yorfa, please understand."{w}{p}"From here, I can shine down on everyone's smiling faces.
There's no greater joy than that. Isn't that right?"{w}{p}"When the sun was lost, the land was shrouded in darkness for a long while."{w}{p}"In that darkness, no one could find any light of hope, and sorrow covered the land."{w}{p}"But I rose into the sky, and made it a place overflowing with smiles and life."{w}{p}"There's no greater joy than this!
You were happy about it too, Yorfa!"{w}

"Even if this body of mine is destroyed,
I want to go on shining on the land
until the very last moment."{w}

{0E}"Ugh, honestly! You're all exaggerating!
If someone's in trouble, I help them.{0F}
That's only natural, right?"{w}

{0E}"One way or another, you guys sure know a lot...
I really do need to study.{0F}
And I have to work harder at alchemy, too..."{w}

{0E}"Ninja! Ninja's the way to go!
YAMURU IS DECAPITATED!{0F}
*ding* R.I.P.!"{w}

"You can just go end up
    *INSIDE THE STONE*
all by yourself!"{w}

{0E}"Those two make an Angel's Window...
I know that one, since I've made it before.{0F}
And then Ma... Mazu... Mazu-ree-tay?"{w}

{0E}"Yamuru!{0F}
...It's all right, okay?"{w}{p}"If I wanted to change classes, I wouldn't be studying alchemy.{w}I'm studying like this because
I decided to keep at it, see?"{w}

"Ah! Don't you run away, you bastard!
I didn't get to lop off a single head!
HEEEADS!!"{w}
